; Opzioni dai tooltype dell'icona (os4). Richiede Assign NGNFS:
; Copia TI1/TI2 (+ .info) in SYS:Storage/DOSDrivers/, monta, controlla il
; volume e il log, smonta e cancella le copie. Nessun accesso alla rete.
;   TI1  VOLUME=TTICON CASE=SENSITIVE TIMEOUT=3 READONLY, (UID=1) spento
;   TI2  UID=abc: tooltype non validi, valgono quelli della Startup
; Risultati: NGNFS:build/os4-ti-out.txt, NGNFS:build/os4-ti1.log e -ti2.log
FailAt 21
Set O NGNFS:build/os4-ti-out.txt
Delete NGNFS:build/os4-ti#?.log QUIET >NIL: *>NIL:
Echo "== copia in SYS:Storage/DOSDrivers" >$O
Copy NGNFS:test/tooltype/os4/TI#? SYS:Storage/DOSDrivers/ QUIET >>$O *>>$O
Echo "== mount TI1" >>$O
Mount SYS:Storage/DOSDrivers/TI1 >>$O *>>$O
Echo "rc=$RC" >>$O
Echo "== mount TI2" >>$O
Mount SYS:Storage/DOSDrivers/TI2 >>$O *>>$O
Echo "rc=$RC" >>$O
Wait 3
Echo "== volumi" >>$O
Assign VOLS >>$O
Echo "== smontaggio" >>$O
Dismount TI1: >>$O *>>$O
Echo "rc=$RC" >>$O
Dismount TI2: >>$O *>>$O
Echo "rc=$RC" >>$O
Echo "== pulizia" >>$O
Delete SYS:Storage/DOSDrivers/TI#? QUIET >>$O *>>$O
Echo "== FINE" >>$O
